# Agentic test gates

Follow `AGENTS.md` for Clarity Coach quality gates.

## Inner gate (Vitest)

- Logic-shaped work: failing colocated Vitest → implement → focused green.
- `cd web-server && npx vitest run <path>` or `npm run test:core`
- `cd client/client/app && npx vitest run <path>` or `npm run test:core`
- Do not chase repo-wide coverage %. Incomplete without unit proof for helpers/adapters/validation.

## Outer gate (Playwright)

- Product UI or API-for-UI: add/update Playwright; prefer `data-test-ids.ts`.
- After apply: always `npm run e2e:pulse` (`client/client/app`); add `e2e:smoke` / `e2e:p0` per AGENTS.md.
- Do not mark OpenSpec apply complete without the ladder when UI/API-for-UI was touched.

## OpenSpec

`openspec/config.yaml` rules require TDD pairs + outer-gate section in `tasks.md`. Apply skill: `.claude/skills/openspec-apply-change/SKILL.md`.
